      "text": "findings_cache  (Phase 1)\n────────────────────────────────\nPK file_hash        TEXT\nPK dimension        TEXT\nPK model_version    TEXT\nPK prompt_version   TEXT\nPK schema_version   TEXT\n   file_path        TEXT\n   findings_json    TEXT\n   spectra_version  TEXT\n   repo_signature   TEXT\n   computed_at      TIMESTAMP\n\nidx_repo (repo_signature)\nidx_age  (computed_at)",
